Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:02:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 46/46] Plugins: overlays only in the open world, and away at
 shops

A plugin overlay (the Map's, the Limits) now shows only in the open world:
every zone that isn't one of its regions, the Abyss's layers or the
legions' airships counts as a dungeon (quest scenes, new zones). And it
goes at a shop: a merchant's list (91 56, the Black Cloud Merchant's as
the Closet plugin reads it) hides it until the player walks, rides or
flies off (eight movement steps of the client within 2 s) or the zone
changes; the game sends nothing when a shop closes. A fourth switch per
plugin in Settings -> Plugins: "Hide its overlay at shops".
